## 5. SSAS — excluded (owner, 2026-09-13)

SSAS is the group **pension scheme**, not a trading company. It has **no dedicated domain/mailbox** —
its correspondence goes to **personal inboxes** (which Peter must never read, charter §3), and it is
dominated by **member personal + financial data** administered by a third party (Empowered Pensions).
High sensitivity, negligible triage value → **excluded from the hub.** Its own **Fishbone SSAS KB**
remains its canonical home; the corporate trustee (Empowered Trustees Ltd, 12291059) is already on
Peter's Companies House watch (SRC-9). If a specific SSAS email ever needs Peter, forward that single
message by hand. Revisit only if the mailbox later turns out to be mostly benign admin.

